		TWAIT 1200, 0
		IF CH_BET:MASTER == 結果
			CALL TOBA_DEALER_TWEET(3, "サシで負け")
			KOMAFUDA:MASTER += CH_PROFIT:MASTER
			連勝:MASTER ++
